  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "How to read this reviewed experiment", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### One accepted campaign, not a live speed test\nEvery value below is generated from the reviewed performance campaign `summary.json`: three repetitions at each of **1, 3, and 5 concurrent UEs**. The exporter repeats immutable reviewed gauges so the evidence remains visible after the temporary benchmark sidecars and 24-hour raw Prometheus history are gone. Use the **Selected UE load** variable for detailed procedure and resource panels. [Experiment contract](https://github.com/abdelrahman-fawaz18/cloud-native-5g-core-platform/blob/main/benchmarks/performance/experiment.json) · [Reviewed report](https://github.com/abdelrahman-fawaz18/cloud-native-5g-core-platform/blob/main/reports/performance-results.md) · [Machine-readable summary](https://github.com/abdelrahman-fawaz18/cloud-native-5g-core-platform/blob/main/benchmarks/performance/results/summary.json)"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Campaign state", "description": "One means the exported campaign passed the deterministic analyzer and has status reviewed_complete.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_campaign_info{status=\"reviewed_complete\"}", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "value", "options": {"1": {"text": "REVIEWED", "color": "green"}}}], "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Accepted conditions", "description": "Three repetitions at each of three UE levels produced nine accepted conditions.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_accepted_conditions", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "max": 9, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 9}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Repetitions / level", "description": "Independent accepted repetitions for every concurrency level.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_repetitions", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "max": 3, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Measured interval", "description": "iperf3 measured interval after the excluded three-second warm-up.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_measurement_duration_seconds", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "stat", "title": "Idle baseline", "description": "Duration of the timestamped idle observation. Component comparisons below use accepted active-condition windows filtered by runtime Pod identity.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_idle_baseline_duration_seconds", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "stat", "title": "New restarts", "description": "Sum of new container restarts across all nine accepted conditions. Healthy accepted value is zero.", "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(cn5g_performance_reviewed_new_restarts)", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "text", "title": "Traffic scaling", "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### Delivered traffic and contention\nForward TCP was **unbounded** and is the only saturation-oriented stage. Reverse TCP offered **10 Mbit/s per UE** and UDP offered **1 Mbit/s per UE**; their attainment panels therefore show service-load delivery, not downlink capacity."}
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Forward TCP aggregate median", "description": "Median aggregate delivered forward TCP rate at each UE level. The non-monotonic aggregate result characterizes this local simulated path only.", "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_throughput_bits_per_second{direction=\"forward\",scope=\"aggregate\",statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bps", "min": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Forward TCP per-UE median", "description": "Median of the per-UE forward TCP delivered rates. The falling share as concurrency rises is the clearest contention signal.", "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_throughput_bits_per_second{direction=\"forward\",scope=\"per_ue_median\",statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bps", "min": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Forward TCP fairness", "description": "Median Jain fairness index across per-UE forward TCP results. One is perfectly equal; it does not indicate high throughput by itself.", "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 22},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_jain_fairness_ratio{statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 0.95}, {"color": "green", "value": 0.99}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Reverse TCP target delivered", "description": "Median delivered reverse TCP rate divided by the fixed 10 Mbit/s-per-UE offered service load.", "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 22},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_target_attainment_ratio{traffic=\"tcp_reverse\",statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 0.95}, {"color": "green", "value": 0.99}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "bargauge", "title": "UDP target delivered", "description": "Median delivered UDP rate divided by the fixed 1 Mbit/s-per-UE offered load.", "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 22},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_target_attainment_ratio{traffic=\"udp\",statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1.01, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 0.95}, {"color": "green", "value": 0.99}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Forward TCP retransmissions", "description": "Median forward retransmissions per accepted condition. The increase with UE count supports, but does not alone prove, the contention reading.", "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 30},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_tcp_retransmissions{direction=\"forward\",statistic=\"median\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{ue_level}} UEs"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-YlRd"}}, "overrides": []},
