    {
      "id": 24, "type": "text", "title": "Resources and bottleneck reading", "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 55},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### Correlate load with the components that carried it\nResource values are peaks observed inside each accepted traffic window and filtered by that condition's runtime Pod identity. They do not include terminated rollout Pods. At five UEs, the combined UE runtime and single gNB were the leading bottleneck candidates; the experiment did not isolate one causal component."}
    },
    {
      "id": 25, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Median component CPU peak", "description": "Median condition-level CPU peak for principal traffic-path components at the selected UE load. UE is the aggregate of active UE runtime containers.", "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 58},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_component_cpu_peak_cores{ue_level=\"$ue_level\",statistic=\"median\",component=~\"ue/ue|gnb|upf|smf|amf\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{component}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "cores", "min": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "showUnfilled": true, "valueMode": "color", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 26, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Median component memory peak", "description": "Median condition-level working-set memory peak for principal traffic-path components at the selected UE load.", "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 58},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cn5g_performance_reviewed_component_memory_peak_bytes{ue_level=\"$ue_level\",statistic=\"median\",component=~\"ue/ue|gnb|upf|smf|amf\"}", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{component}}"}],
